# Máxima Formación - Project Rules

## Project Overview
This is a Next.js 16 application for Máxima Formación, an educational platform offering courses, masters programs, consulting services, and innovation solutions. The design follows a cinematic noir aesthetic with dark backgrounds and amber accents.

## Tech Stack
- **Framework**: Next.js 16 (App Router)
- **Language**: TypeScript
- **Styling**: Tailwind CSS
- **Animations**: Framer Motion
- **Icons**: Lucide React
- **Authentication**: Clerk (@clerk/nextjs)
- **State Management**: React useState/useEffect (no external state library)

## Project Structure

```
app/
├── components/          # Reusable UI components
│   ├── Header.tsx       # Global navigation header
│   ├── Footer.tsx       # Global footer
│   ├── FontStyles.tsx   # Custom font definitions
│   └── [Feature]*.tsx   # Feature-specific section components
├── data/               # Mock data and type definitions
│   ├── programs.ts     # Course/Master data
│   └── blogs.ts        # Blog post data
├── [page]/             # Route directories
│   ├── page.tsx        # Page component
│   └── [id]/           # Dynamic routes
│       └── page.tsx
├── globals.css         # Global styles and utilities
├── layout.tsx          # Root layout
└── page.tsx            # Homepage
```

## Design System

### Color Palette
```css
/* Primary Colors */
--black: #000000
--dark-bg: #0a0a0a
--neutral-950: rgb(10, 10, 10)

/* Accent Colors */
--amber-500: rgb(245, 158, 11)  /* Primary accent */
--amber-400: rgb(251, 191, 36)  /* Hover state */

/* Text Colors */
--white: #ffffff               /* Primary text */
--white-80: rgba(255,255,255,0.8)
--white-60: rgba(255,255,255,0.6)
--white-40: rgba(255,255,255,0.4)
--neutral-400: rgb(163, 163, 163)

/* Border Colors */
--border-light: rgba(255,255,255,0.1)
--border-hover: rgba(245,158,11,0.5)
```

### Typography
- **Font Family**: ZTNature (custom), system fallbacks
- **Headings**: font-black, 
  - H1: text-5xl to text-9xl (responsive)
  - H2: text-4xl to text-6xl
  - H3: text-2xl to text-3xl
- **Body**: font-light, leading-relaxed
- **Labels**: text-xs to text-sm, tracking-[0.5em], uppercase

### Spacing
- Section padding: py-32 px-6 md:px-12
- Container max-width: max-w-7xl or max-w-[1400px]
- Card padding: p-8 to p-10
- Component gaps: gap-6 to gap-12

### Animation Patterns
Always use Framer Motion with these patterns:

```tsx
// Scroll-triggered fade-in
<motion.div
  initial={{ opacity: 0, y: 30 }}
  whileInView={{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }}
  viewport={{ once: true }}
  transition={{ duration: 0.8 }}
>

// Staggered children
transition={{ delay: idx * 0.1 }}

// Parallax scroll effect
const { scrollYProgress } = useScroll();
const yRange = useTransform(scrollYProgress, [0, 1], [0, -200]);
```

## Component Patterns

### Page Structure
Every page should follow this pattern:

```tsx
'use client';

import React, { useState } from 'react';
import { FontStyles } from '../components/FontStyles';
import { Header } from '../components/Header';
import { Footer } from '../components/Footer';
// Import page-specific sections

export default function PageName() {
  const [isMenuOpen, setIsMenuOpen] = useState(false);
  
  return (
    <div className="bg-black min-h-screen text-white selection:bg-amber-500/30 overflow-x-hidden">
      <FontStyles />
      <div className="grain" />
      
      <Header isMenuOpen={isMenuOpen} setIsMenuOpen={setIsMenuOpen} />

      <main className="relative z-10">
        {/* Page sections */}
      </main>

      <Footer />
    </div>
  );
}
```

### Section Component Pattern

```tsx
'use client';

import React from 'react';
import { motion } from 'framer-motion';
import { IconName } from 'lucide-react';

export const SectionName: React.FC = () => {
  return (
    <section className="py-32 px-6 md:px-12 bg-[#0a0a0a]">
      <div className="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
        <motion.div
          initial={{ opacity: 0, y: 30 }}
          whileInView={{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }}
          viewport={{ once: true }}
          className="text-center mb-20"
        >
          <span className="text-amber-500 text-sm font-medium tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-4 block">
            Section Label
          </span>
          <h2 className="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-black  mb-6">
            Section Title
          </h2>
          <p className="text-white/60 text-lg font-light max-w-2xl mx-auto">
            Section description
          </p>
        </motion.div>
        
        {/* Section content */}
      </div>
    </section>
  );
};
```

### Hero Section Pattern

```tsx
<section className="relative h-screen flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden">
  <motion.div style={{ y: yRange }} className="absolute inset-0 z-0 h-[120%]">
    <div className="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-black/90 via-transparent to-black z-10" />
    <img src="..." className="w-full h-full object-cover" />
  </motion.div>
  
  <div className="relative z-20 text-center px-6 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
    {/* Hero content */}
  </div>
</section>
```

### Card Pattern

```tsx
<motion.div
  initial={{ opacity: 0, y: 30 }}
  whileInView={{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }}
  viewport={{ once: true }}
  className="p-8 border border-white/10 bg-white/5 hover:border-amber-500/50 hover:bg-white/10 transition-all duration-300"
>
  <Icon className="text-amber-500 mb-6" size={32} />
  <h3 className="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Title</h3>
  <p className="text-white/60 font-light leading-relaxed">Description</p>
</motion.div>
```

### Button Patterns

```tsx
// Primary button (white bg)
<a className="group inline-flex items-center gap-3 bg-white text-black px-8 py-4 text-base font-medium rounded-full hover:bg-amber-500 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300">
  Button Text
  <ArrowRight size={18} className="group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" />
</a>

// Secondary button (outline)
<a className="border border-white/30 text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-full hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors">
  Button Text
</a>
```

## Naming Conventions

### Components
- PascalCase for component names
- Prefix with feature name: `Blog*`, `Program*`, `Innovacion*`
- Suffix with type: `*Section`, `*Card`, `*Grid`, `*Header`

### Files
- Components: `ComponentName.tsx`
- Pages: `page.tsx` (Next.js convention)
- Data: `feature.ts` (lowercase)

### CSS Classes
- Use Tailwind utilities
- Custom classes in globals.css: kebab-case
- Animation classes: descriptive names

## Data Patterns

### Data File Structure

```typescript
// Interface definition
export interface DataItem {
  id: number;
  title: string;
  // ... other fields
}

// Data array
export const ALL_ITEMS: DataItem[] = [
  { id: 1, title: '...', ... },
];

// Helper functions
export const getItemById = (id: number): DataItem | undefined => {
  return ALL_ITEMS.find(item => item.id === id);
};
```

### Dynamic Route Pattern

```tsx
'use client';

import { use } from 'react';

interface PageProps {
  params: Promise<{ id: string }> | { id: string };
}

export default function DynamicPage({ params }: PageProps) {
  const resolvedParams = use(params instanceof Promise ? params : Promise.resolve(params));
  const id = parseInt(resolvedParams.id, 10);
  const item = getItemById(id);

  if (!item) {
    return <NotFoundContent />;
  }

  return <PageContent item={item} />;
}
```

## Common Utilities

### Grain Effect
Add film grain overlay for cinematic effect:
```tsx
<div className="grain" />
```

### Text Stroke Effect
For outlined text headings:
```tsx
<span className="text-stroke text-white">TEXT</span>
```

### No Scrollbar
Hide scrollbar in horizontal scroll areas:
```tsx
<div className="overflow-x-auto no-scrollbar">
```

## Best Practices

1. **Always use 'use client'** for components with interactivity
2. **Prefer composition** over complex conditional rendering
3. **Keep sections modular** - one responsibility per component
4. **Use consistent spacing** - follow the py-32 px-6 pattern
5. **Animate on scroll** - use whileInView for performance
6. **Mobile-first responsive** - start with mobile, add md: and lg: breakpoints
7. **Accessibility** - use semantic HTML, proper heading hierarchy
8. **External links** - always use target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"

## Authentication (Clerk)

### Setup
Authentication is handled by Clerk using `@clerk/nextjs`. The middleware (`middleware.ts`) protects routes using `clerkMiddleware()`.

### Environment Variables
Required in `.env.local`:
```bash
NEXT_PUBLIC_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=YOUR_PUBLISHABLE_KEY
CLERK_SECRET_KEY=YOUR_SECRET_KEY
NEXT_PUBLIC_CLERK_SIGN_IN_URL=/sign-in
NEXT_PUBLIC_CLERK_SIGN_UP_URL=/sign-up
```

### Auth Components
Import from `@clerk/nextjs`:
- `<SignedIn>` / `<SignedOut>` - Conditional rendering based on auth state
- `<UserButton>` - User avatar with dropdown menu
- `<SignIn>` / `<SignUp>` - Embedded auth forms

### Custom Auth Pages Pattern
Custom sign-in/sign-up pages follow the design system:

```tsx
// app/sign-in/[[...sign-in]]/page.tsx
import { SignIn } from '@clerk/nextjs';

<SignIn
  appearance={{
    variables: {
      colorPrimary: '#f59e0b',      // amber-500
      colorBackground: '#0a0a0a',    // dark-bg
      colorText: '#ffffff',
      colorInputBackground: '#171717',
    },
    elements: {
      card: 'bg-[#0a0a0a] border border-white/10',
      formButtonPrimary: 'bg-amber-500 hover:bg-amber-400 text-black',
      formFieldInput: 'bg-white/5 border-white/10 text-white focus:border-amber-500',
      socialButtonsBlockButton: 'bg-white/5 border border-white/10 hover:border-amber-500/50',
    }
  }}
/>
```

### Protecting Routes
In `middleware.ts`, public routes are defined with `createRouteMatcher`:

```typescript
const isPublicRoute = createRouteMatcher([
  '/',
  '/sign-in(.*)',
  '/sign-up(.*)',
  '/programas(.*)',
  // ... other public routes
]);

export default clerkMiddleware(async (auth, req) => {
  if (!isPublicRoute(req)) {
    await auth.protect();
  }
});
```

## Routes Overview

| Route | Description |
|-------|-------------|
| `/` | Homepage with hero, stats, courses |
| `/sign-in` | Custom sign-in page |
| `/sign-up` | Custom sign-up page |
| `/perfil` | User profile management (protected) |
| `/pricing` | Pro plan pricing and comparison |
| `/conocenos` | About us page |
| `/programas` | Course/Master catalog |
| `/programas/[id]` | Individual program details |
| `/consultoria` | Statistical consulting services |
| `/innovacion` | Biomáxima innovation page |
| `/blog` | Blog listing |
| `/blog/[id]` | Individual blog post |
| `/contacto` | Contact page |

